{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村沙友理です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の８月２７日は\n私の２４歳の誕生日でした(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハの最中に みんなからケーキもらいました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/08/28/9538525/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も大好きなフルーツタルト"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/08/28/9538525/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントもありがとうございます(*^_^*)\nリハの合間に 読んでますー(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は バナナマンさんと児嶋さんが一緒に来てくださりました(*^_^*)\nお兄ちゃん嬉しい♡\nバナナムーンで 白米様のヒムペキver.を\n歌って下さったのをスタッフさんから聞いていたので\nお礼を言えました(*^_^*)\n日村さんが 本物の白米様かもしれないと\n思わされる素敵なアレンジで凄く嬉しかったです！\nお稽古の時に いつも白米様を聞いてくれてるらしいです！\n本当に嬉しいー(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/08/28/9538525/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日ブログなのに\n頭が回ってないのか\nこんな感じでごめんなさい。\nとりあえず、あと二日間 頑張らなきゃー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は晴れるかな？？\n成功しますように！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2016/08/28/9538525/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいらぶー"}],"source":"archive"}